{"3415640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Acornia: Mirror Worlds", "steam_appid": 3415640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Acornia</strong>, once a prosperous tree village, now stands in ruins due to the <strong>Duramen</strong>’s influence - a <strong>dark mirror dimension</strong> teeming with <strong>angry spirits</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Alva</strong>: a determined squirrel returning to Acornia to reopen her family's <strong>dessert shop</strong>. Travelling in and out of the Duramen, Alva works double-time to <strong>restore the village</strong> using her formidable <strong>cheek pouches</strong>: spitting treats on plates…or at a spirit’s face!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415640/extras/78237415348ae43a0e95137dca94c8a0.avif?t=1787752876\" width=1200 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switch dimensions</strong> any time, anywhere, to play both sides of a complementary gameloop:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>light dimension</strong>, fill up display cases and plates with <strong>mouthwatering desserts</strong> - nothing like a sweet treat to brighten up a neighbor’s day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>Duramen dimension</strong>, mow down angry spirits with a barrage of <strong>weaponized pastries</strong> carried in your cheek pouches!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415640/extras/4d46b2f1140e12524fce57da2338d891.poster.avif?t=1787752876\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415640/extras/4d46b2f1140e12524fce57da2338d891.webm?t=1787752876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415640/extras/4d46b2f1140e12524fce57da2338d891.mp4?t=1787752876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415640/extras/8601b038c0b3e38aeadb433f64764184.avif?t=1787752876\" width=1200 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook up a multitude of decadent <strong>sweet treats</strong> and grow your shop’s <strong>reputation</strong>!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cater to your <strong>customers’ seasonal preferences</strong> for more profit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand and customise your <strong>store’s appearance</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become self-sufficient with <strong>agriculture</strong> and <strong>animal rearing</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire <strong>employees</strong> and automate daily tasks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415640/extras/1409f328c10bc0e5a4c457f577ba0fb7.poster.avif?t=1787752876\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415640/extras/1409f328c10bc0e5a4c457f577ba0fb7.webm?t=1787752876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415640/extras/1409f328c10bc0e5a4c457f577ba0fb7.mp4?t=1787752876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415640/extras/46a9aa9c7378b1e9083160e6040fd385.avif?t=1787752876\" width=1200 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swallow new <strong>recipes</strong> and <strong>materials</strong> in your cheek pouches as you explore the <strong>Duramen’s dungeons</strong>. Scurry across multiple floors, dodge-roll past <strong>traps</strong>, and shoot <strong>enemies</strong> down with a relentless stream of pastries until you reach the boss! Run out of ammo? Swallow enemies whole and use them to topple the next!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415640/extras/51e44b117b6036fb20e2baa61f44908a.poster.avif?t=1787752876\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415640/extras/51e44b117b6036fb20e2baa61f44908a.webm?t=1787752876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415640/extras/51e44b117b6036fb20e2baa61f44908a.mp4?t=1787752876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415640/extras/5bc2bc0d112cc57cee31c9681b215ea5.avif?t=1787752876\" width=1200 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend over <strong>25 unique villagers</strong>, each with their own <strong>backstory</strong>, <strong>role</strong>, and daily <strong>routine</strong> in Acornia! Learn more about their <strong>personalities</strong> and <strong>relationship</strong> with Alva in their dedicated <strong>side quests</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some may visit depending on the <strong>season</strong>. Enjoy the <strong>seasonal events</strong> they set up (bug catching, flower decorating, etc.) to unlock <strong>seasonal recipes</strong> and <strong>furniture sets</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415640/extras/21df126dc8c6b612409b07db9081b160.avif?t=1787752876\" width=1200 height=550 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415640/extras/3cc7409253b4c468f94e11a2b4585887.avif?t=1787752876\" width=1200 height=550 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Acornia</strong>, once a prosperous tree village, now stands in ruins due to the <strong>Duramen</strong>’s influence - a <strong>dark mirror dimension</strong> teeming with <strong>angry spirits</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Alva</strong>: a determined squirrel returning to Acornia to reopen her family's <strong>dessert shop</strong>. Travelling in and out of the Duramen, Alva works double-time to <strong>restore the village</strong> using her formidable <strong>cheek pouches</strong>: spitting treats on plates…or at a spirit’s face!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415640/extras/78237415348ae43a0e95137dca94c8a0.avif?t=1787752876\" width=1200 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switch dimensions</strong> any time, anywhere, to play both sides of a complementary gameloop:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>light dimension</strong>, fill up display cases and plates with <strong>mouthwatering desserts</strong> - nothing like a sweet treat to brighten up a neighbor’s day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>Duramen dimension</strong>, mow down angry spirits with a barrage of <strong>weaponized pastries</strong> carried in your cheek pouches!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415640/extras/4d46b2f1140e12524fce57da2338d891.poster.avif?t=1787752876\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415640/extras/4d46b2f1140e12524fce57da2338d891.webm?t=1787752876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415640/extras/4d46b2f1140e12524fce57da2338d891.mp4?t=1787752876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415640/extras/8601b038c0b3e38aeadb433f64764184.avif?t=1787752876\" width=1200 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook up a multitude of decadent <strong>sweet treats</strong> and grow your shop’s <strong>reputation</strong>!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cater to your <strong>customers’ seasonal preferences</strong> for more profit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand and customise your <strong>store’s appearance</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become self-sufficient with <strong>agriculture</strong> and <strong>animal rearing</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire <strong>employees</strong> and automate daily tasks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415640/extras/1409f328c10bc0e5a4c457f577ba0fb7.poster.avif?t=1787752876\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415640/extras/1409f328c10bc0e5a4c457f577ba0fb7.webm?t=1787752876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415640/extras/1409f328c10bc0e5a4c457f577ba0fb7.mp4?t=1787752876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415640/extras/46a9aa9c7378b1e9083160e6040fd385.avif?t=1787752876\" width=1200 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swallow new <strong>recipes</strong> and <strong>materials</strong> in your cheek pouches as you explore the <strong>Duramen’s dungeons</strong>. Scurry across multiple floors, dodge-roll past <strong>traps</strong>, and shoot <strong>enemies</strong> down with a relentless stream of pastries until you reach the boss! Run out of ammo? Swallow enemies whole and use them to topple the next!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415640/extras/51e44b117b6036fb20e2baa61f44908a.poster.avif?t=1787752876\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415640/extras/51e44b117b6036fb20e2baa61f44908a.webm?t=1787752876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415640/extras/51e44b117b6036fb20e2baa61f44908a.mp4?t=1787752876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415640/extras/5bc2bc0d112cc57cee31c9681b215ea5.avif?t=1787752876\" width=1200 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend over <strong>25 unique villagers</strong>, each with their own <strong>backstory</strong>, <strong>role</strong>, and daily <strong>routine</strong> in Acornia! Learn more about their <strong>personalities</strong> and <strong>relationship</strong> with Alva in their dedicated <strong>side quests</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some may visit depending on the <strong>season</strong>. Enjoy the <strong>seasonal events</strong> they set up (bug catching, flower decorating, etc.) to unlock <strong>seasonal recipes</strong> and <strong>furniture sets</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415640/extras/21df126dc8c6b612409b07db9081b160.avif?t=1787752876\" width=1200 height=550 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415640/extras/3cc7409253b4c468f94e11a2b4585887.avif?t=1787752876\" width=1200 height=550 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Acornia: Mirror Worlds is a bake-and-brawl management adventure game! Run your shop in one dimension, fight angry spirits in the other. Your special skill? Stuffing your bottomless cheek pouches with treats - to plate up or shoot up enemies!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spani